# Agent workflow

Follow `docs/CURSOR_CONTRACT.md`.

Before substantial edits:
- inspect git status;
- inspect relevant code and docs;
- define scope and DoD;
- use Plan Mode for architectural or multi-file tasks.

After implementation:
- run lint;
- run typecheck;
- run tests;
- run build;
- run domain/benchmark checks when relevant.

Do not merge main.
Do not force push.
Do not implement the next roadmap version without an explicit request.

Finish every task using the exact report sections defined in `docs/CURSOR_CONTRACT.md`.
